Dolphin SDK 2001 reconstruction attribution

The C sources in this directory, and the headers under include/dolsdk2001,
are copied from the community decompilation of the 5/22/2001 Dolphin SDK
libraries:

  https://github.com/doldecomp/dolsdk2001
  commit eb1234c45e6df75757c652c835507ca89674f9a8

Credit belongs to that project's contributors and to the original Nintendo
SDK authors. These are public reconstructions, not an original SDK source
release. Preserve upstream notices and comments. No LICENSE file was present
at the commit above; this attribution notice grants no new license.

Local changes reproduce Frontline's Dec 17 2001 SDK build, in part from the
later dolsdk2004 reconstruction used by Rising Sun (see src/dolphin/NOTICE).
They were made with AI assistance; every modified file and the evidence for
each change are listed in docs/Dolphin.md under "Local modifications".

